(6268358, 927571, 94241, '<td valign="top">Great concept!<br/> <br/>Also, kudos for shooting glass and chrome on high-key.  It came out pretty well.  There''s an errant reflection in the spoon that reveals the environment.  The glass seems a little overexposed around the edges.  I''m going to suggest some off-scene black photoboard or cardboard on the sides to help cut the light there, but glass is so finicky I''ve no idea if that would even work or not.</td>', 'Great concept! Also, kudos for shooting glass and chrome on high-key.  It came out pretty well.  There''s an errant reflection in the spoon that reveals the environment.  The glass seems a little overexposed around the edges.  I''m going to suggest some off-scene black photoboard or cardboard on the sides to help cut the light there, but glass is so finicky I''ve no idea if that would even work or not.', '2011-01-03 00:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
