(6270535, 927755, 119188, '<td valign="top">very creative but I think the focus should have been more on the butterfly. It could be my eyes but the focus point seems to be on the surface.</td>', 'very creative but I think the focus should have been more on the butterfly. It could be my eyes but the focus point seems to be on the surface.', '2011-01-04 16:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270669, 927780, 29777, '<td valign="top">There seems to be a lot going on here in the way of texture and color. I also like the lighting, very nice. While the image is interesting, I can''t seem to find a spot to rest my eyes. The box that I assume is the subject of the shot is a bit dark compared to the other bright spots. Also, everything is in sharp focus which also does not help direct my eye toward the subject.</td>', 'There seems to be a lot going on here in the way of texture and color. I also like the lighting, very nice. While the image is interesting, I can''t seem to find a spot to rest my eyes. The box that I assume is the subject of the shot is a bit dark compared to the other bright spots. Also, everything is in sharp focus which also does not help direct my eye toward the subject.', '2011-01-04 17:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6270676, 927551, 29777, '<td valign="top">I like the warm light on the face of the structure, nice. I wonder if the drama would be increased if the dark areas were even darker. What would this shot look like if it where taken 30 or 40 minutes later?</td>', 'I like the warm light on the face of the structure, nice. I wonder if the drama would be increased if the dark areas were even darker. What would this shot look like if it where taken 30 or 40 minutes later?', '2011-01-04 17:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
