(6270682, 927928, 29777, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge. I would love to see another example of the same shot with the mirrors in focus and the face blurred. I think that would give an entirly new feeling. I like how the eyes are both in the shot.</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge. I would love to see another example of the same shot with the mirrors in focus and the face blurred. I think that would give an entirly new feeling. I like how the eyes are both in the shot.', '2011-01-04 17:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
