(6270889, 927896, 12405, '<td valign="top">Looks like my wife''s desk when she''s playing with a poem she''s trying to get out. Except this one is going to carry a bit of bad news to someone. Normally I don''t like photos that I can''t find focus in, but the out of focus works for this and it''s in focus enough to get the story of what is about to happen.</td>', 'Looks like my wife''s desk when she''s playing with a poem she''s trying to get out. Except this one is going to carry a bit of bad news to someone. Normally I don''t like photos that I can''t find focus in, but the out of focus works for this and it''s in focus enough to get the story of what is about to happen.', '2011-01-04 20:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
