(6271662, 927755, 94241, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love your idea.  I think the image doesn''t work for me because the butterfly blends in to what''s behind him.  If you shot this from a much lower angle, so that the butterfly''s profile broke the horizon line, I think it might emphasize more the rise and escape.</td>', 'I absolutely love your idea.  I think the image doesn''t work for me because the butterfly blends in to what''s behind him.  If you shot this from a much lower angle, so that the butterfly''s profile broke the horizon line, I think it might emphasize more the rise and escape.', '2011-01-05 04:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6271665, 927874, 94241, '<td valign="top">Nice idea to break it all the way through like that.  My eye is following that crack right across the image.</td>', 'Nice idea to break it all the way through like that.  My eye is following that crack right across the image.', '2011-01-05 04:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6271668, 927951, 20799, '<td valign="top">Very creative, I love it. But, too many coal pieces? Oh right, the buttons... 9 from me.</td>', 'Very creative, I love it. But, too many coal pieces? Oh right, the buttons... 9 from me.', '2011-01-05 05:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
