(6273374, 927849, 108069, '<td valign="top">Outstanding image. So sharp and smooth and interestingly composed. Great display of the challenge theme. An eye-catcher from thumb to full-size. Nice one.</td>', 'Outstanding image. So sharp and smooth and interestingly composed. Great display of the challenge theme. An eye-catcher from thumb to full-size. Nice one.', '2011-01-06 12:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6273379, 926757, 108069, '<td valign="top">Horseshoecrab carried a heavy load. Well spotted and great entry. I would like more drama, though. Maybe a bit of the sea or some beach or dunes, so we can get some perspective on where this sad soul lost his way. Just how far off course is he? But it''s a good one regardless.</td>', 'Horseshoecrab carried a heavy load. Well spotted and great entry. I would like more drama, though. Maybe a bit of the sea or some beach or dunes, so we can get some perspective on where this sad soul lost his way. Just how far off course is he? But it''s a good one regardless.', '2011-01-06 12:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6273386, 927921, 108069, '<td valign="top">Just awesome. What a photograph. Lines and patterns and rays and cubes and all the geometric shapes in all the most pleasing tones. Killer.</td>', 'Just awesome. What a photograph. Lines and patterns and rays and cubes and all the geometric shapes in all the most pleasing tones. Killer.', '2011-01-06 12:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6273392, 927826, 108069, '<td valign="top">I have to say this is the most outstanding framing of a cardboard box I have ever seen. To be this tightly cropped and remain 100% within the frame is remarkable. I must own crappy cardboard boxes.<br/> <br/>That said, this is an annual mental image a lot of us share, and this is an excellent portrayal of it. Great for the challenge as well.</td>', 'I have to say this is the most outstanding framing of a cardboard box I have ever seen. To be this tightly cropped and remain 100% within the frame is remarkable. I must own crappy cardboard boxes. That said, this is an annual mental image a lot of us share, and this is an excellent portrayal of it. Great for the challenge as well.', '2011-01-06 12:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6273397, 927951, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Clever. Very nice image, but... in my opinion I don''t think the shallow depth of field helped you here. The snow (or white foam that represents snow) is enough of a fade off into the sunset effect that I''d like all the coal and the carrot to be in focus. I''d certainly like more detail and contrast within the carrot itself.<br/> <br/>Still a very nice image and, again, very creative.</td>', 'Great idea. Clever. Very nice image, but... in my opinion I don''t think the shallow depth of field helped you here. The snow (or white foam that represents snow) is enough of a fade off into the sunset effect that I''d like all the coal and the carrot to be in focus. I''d certainly like more detail and contrast within the carrot itself. Still a very nice image and, again, very creative.', '2011-01-06 12:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6273399, 927815, 108069, '<td valign="top">Clean and sharp and visually interesting image, and very well composed.</td>', 'Clean and sharp and visually interesting image, and very well composed.', '2011-01-06 12:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6273402, 927879, 108069, '<td valign="top">I am failing to see the connection with the theme, but I do like all the geometric shapes, especially offset by the rectangular frame in which they are presented.</td>', 'I am failing to see the connection with the theme, but I do like all the geometric shapes, especially offset by the rectangular frame in which they are presented.', '2011-01-06 12:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6273405, 927075, 108069, '<td valign="top">Tell me about it, and -- I''m not kidding -- my tree this year was a foot high. A ball still fell and broke. Very nice focal plane. All the relevant bits are sharp and your eye certainly knows where to go. There does seem to be a weird rhombus in the top third that''s shaded a bit off, but no matter. Strong image.</td>', 'Tell me about it, and -- I''m not kidding -- my tree this year was a foot high. A ball still fell and broke. Very nice focal plane. All the relevant bits are sharp and your eye certainly knows where to go. There does seem to be a weird rhombus in the top third that''s shaded a bit off, but no matter. Strong image.', '2011-01-06 12:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6273408, 927870, 108069, '<td valign="top">Fabulously insane. Your unending creativity is only matched by your technical prowess. Always a delight to see what you''re up to and how you''ve done it. Stellar.</td>', 'Fabulously insane. Your unending creativity is only matched by your technical prowess. Always a delight to see what you''re up to and how you''ve done it. Stellar.', '2011-01-06 12:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
