(6273546, 927822, 108069, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea. I think it would be stronger if you had offset it a bit. Reflection obviously remains the same, but give a bit more detail in the wood and this starts to get really, really interesting, and gains a mood: For me. But that''s me. Mostly it''s the mirror smack dab in the frame. it''s too unsubtle to bring out the beautiful subtle qualities you have in this photo.</td>', 'Very nice idea. I think it would be stronger if you had offset it a bit. Reflection obviously remains the same, but give a bit more detail in the wood and this starts to get really, really interesting, and gains a mood: For me. But that''s me. Mostly it''s the mirror smack dab in the frame. it''s too unsubtle to bring out the beautiful subtle qualities you have in this photo.', '2011-01-06 14:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6273608, 927847, 108069, '<td valign="top">Awesome. I love the muted tones, the contrast that doesn''t make your eyes hurt, and yet some very nice detail. [It''s actually what I was going for in my last photo but bombed; I hope this does a lot better, and I''ll help] <br/> <br/>It''d be an excellent print.</td>', 'Awesome. I love the muted tones, the contrast that doesn''t make your eyes hurt, and yet some very nice detail. [It''s actually what I was going for in my last photo but bombed; I hope this does a lot better, and I''ll help]  It''d be an excellent print.', '2011-01-06 14:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6273612, 927928, 108069, '<td valign="top">Very creative. My one complaint is that she''s too colorful, and by that I mean that it might imply happiness, which a breakup usually isn''t. I think if she were desaturated and maybe the external surface were colorful it would reinforce the message a lot more. But it''s very creative and well done.</td>', 'Very creative. My one complaint is that she''s too colorful, and by that I mean that it might imply happiness, which a breakup usually isn''t. I think if she were desaturated and maybe the external surface were colorful it would reinforce the message a lot more. But it''s very creative and well done.', '2011-01-06 14:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6273716, 927291, 61396, '<td valign="top">I like how busy this is. The small piece of scenery at the top right gives the image a sense of proportion.</td>', 'I like how busy this is. The small piece of scenery at the top right gives the image a sense of proportion.', '2011-01-06 15:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6273788, 927264, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice and pleasing photo. I couldn''t pull it off, but you have. Nice work.</td>', 'Nice and pleasing photo. I couldn''t pull it off, but you have. Nice work.', '2011-01-06 16:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6273790, 927699, 108069, '<td valign="top">Holy hell this is amazing. The power, the mood, the sharp and jagged vs. the smooth. Incredible. My favorite.</td>', 'Holy hell this is amazing. The power, the mood, the sharp and jagged vs. the smooth. Incredible. My favorite.', '2011-01-06 16:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274170, 927698, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice use of contrast. Not only with the color, but also the liveliness vs withering.</td>', 'Nice use of contrast. Not only with the color, but also the liveliness vs withering.', '2011-01-06 20:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274176, 927727, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like what you did here. Including the piece of branch, needles, and tree skirt really set this up.</td>', 'I like what you did here. Including the piece of branch, needles, and tree skirt really set this up.', '2011-01-06 21:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274179, 927198, 114225, '<td valign="top">Yum. I really like the colors in the candy. I kind of wish there wasn''t the food in front of the candy, it''s a bit distracting.</td>', 'Yum. I really like the colors in the candy. I kind of wish there wasn''t the food in front of the candy, it''s a bit distracting.', '2011-01-06 21:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274183, 927825, 114225, '<td valign="top">Heh, nice play on words :)<br/>Normally I would think the tilted subject was a mistake, but here I feels more intentional and adds a bit of dynamics to the photo.</td>', 'Heh, nice play on words :)Normally I would think the tilted subject was a mistake, but here I feels more intentional and adds a bit of dynamics to the photo.', '2011-01-06 21:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274188, 927699, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot! The depth of field is absolutely perfect, the details are amazing, and the spray of water is stunning.</td>', 'Wonderful shot! The depth of field is absolutely perfect, the details are amazing, and the spray of water is stunning.', '2011-01-06 21:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274189, 927964, 114225, '<td valign="top">Oh, it took me a minute to understand what I was seeing here. Did you eliminate some colors?</td>', 'Oh, it took me a minute to understand what I was seeing here. Did you eliminate some colors?', '2011-01-06 21:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274197, 927423, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is a cool photo. Cool use of gelled flashes to make the scene extra interesting.<br/>I''m really struggling to see how this fits the theme. I will continue to think about it, and come back later.</td>', 'This is a cool photo. Cool use of gelled flashes to make the scene extra interesting.I''m really struggling to see how this fits the theme. I will continue to think about it, and come back later.', '2011-01-06 21:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274201, 927755, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very creative effect here. Nice soft lighting. The only thing I''m not caring for is that primary blue background, it''s too bright for me.</td>', 'Very creative effect here. Nice soft lighting. The only thing I''m not caring for is that primary blue background, it''s too bright for me.', '2011-01-06 21:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274208, 926856, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice bold (but not over-saturated) colors and a nice classic feel in this photo.</td>', 'Nice bold (but not over-saturated) colors and a nice classic feel in this photo.', '2011-01-06 21:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274215, 927965, 114225, '<td valign="top">I can practically smell it. I like the side lighting here, really helps to bring out the texture. The only thing this is missing (in my opinion) is tack sharp focus.</td>', 'I can practically smell it. I like the side lighting here, really helps to bring out the texture. The only thing this is missing (in my opinion) is tack sharp focus.', '2011-01-06 21:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274218, 927285, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really like the choice of black and white here. It brings out the details and textures of the scene.</td>', 'I really like the choice of black and white here. It brings out the details and textures of the scene.', '2011-01-06 21:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274225, 927571, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here, and the touch of color near the bottom with the mint is very nice.<br/>I''m not liking the super bright white that is getting in the way of some of the details. For example, the spoon has a spot that is completely white and breaks up the lines.</td>', 'I like the idea here, and the touch of color near the bottom with the mint is very nice.I''m not liking the super bright white that is getting in the way of some of the details. For example, the spoon has a spot that is completely white and breaks up the lines.', '2011-01-06 21:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274418, 927952, 18778, '<td valign="top">I can really appreciate the symbolism here.  I guess at some point, we''ve all gotten screwed... The pic being divided into quadrants is an interesting touch- provides good continuity with the cross in the screws.  I also like the silver blue tone.</td>', 'I can really appreciate the symbolism here.  I guess at some point, we''ve all gotten screwed... The pic being divided into quadrants is an interesting touch- provides good continuity with the cross in the screws.  I also like the silver blue tone.', '2011-01-06 23:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274593, 927805, 123348, '<td valign="top">David Cassidy...that made me smile! Nice layout and capture...8</td>', 'David Cassidy...that made me smile! Nice layout and capture...8', '2011-01-07 01:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274942, 927659, 117804, '<td valign="top">very good, we can almost taste them :-)</td>', 'very good, we can almost taste them :-)', '2011-01-07 13:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274956, 927503, 117804, '<td valign="top">I just can''t get it...</td>', 'I just can''t get it...', '2011-01-07 13:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6275047, 927870, 117804, '<td valign="top">Even the hair is feather like... :-)</td>', 'Even the hair is feather like... :-)', '2011-01-07 14:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6275440, 927908, 31597, '<td valign="top">I would have scored this higher if the yellow was toned down.</td>', 'I would have scored this higher if the yellow was toned down.', '2011-01-07 20:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6275682, 927870, 112739, '<td valign="top">Dude, how are we supposed to score such a bizarre image? It makes me laugh, makes me shake my head, makes me smile knowing you put immeasurable time into the concept and then making it a reality.  You have my respect for being the most creative and outlandish photographer I know.  In my own interpretation of the challenge, I''m not sure you fully 100% satisfied it.</td>', 'Dude, how are we supposed to score such a bizarre image? It makes me laugh, makes me shake my head, makes me smile knowing you put immeasurable time into the concept and then making it a reality.  You have my respect for being the most creative and outlandish photographer I know.  In my own interpretation of the challenge, I''m not sure you fully 100% satisfied it.', '2011-01-07 22:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6275691, 927423, 112739, '<td valign="top">Awesome photo, great time lapse scene. I am not all together sure it meets the challenge though. I''m not feeling the bits and pieces anywhere. Interpretation is so broad on this challenge.</td>', 'Awesome photo, great time lapse scene. I am not all together sure it meets the challenge though. I''m not feeling the bits and pieces anywhere. Interpretation is so broad on this challenge.', '2011-01-07 22:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6275729, 927369, 113767, '<td valign="top">we''ll give this one the brush off.</td>', 'we''ll give this one the brush off.', '2011-01-07 23:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6275761, 927791, 68947, '<td valign="top">Nicely shot, very well edited piece.  Came back on a second pass through of all and just "got" it! LOL  DRILL BITS and CHESS PIECES!  Ok...duhhhh....bumping up the score now. :)</td>', 'Nicely shot, very well edited piece.  Came back on a second pass through of all and just "got" it! LOL  DRILL BITS and CHESS PIECES!  Ok...duhhhh....bumping up the score now. :)', '2011-01-07 23:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
