(6276598, 926808, 29777, '<td valign="top">clever title and a wonderful shot. Love the tone. I might have increased the contrast a bit more to make the metal bits pop more.</td>', 'clever title and a wonderful shot. Love the tone. I might have increased the contrast a bit more to make the metal bits pop more.', '2011-01-08 17:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
