(6276968, 927321, 51747, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the processing. I would have either taken it further or toned it down a bit. I get the feeling that this is somehow incomplete. 6</td>', 'I like the idea of the processing. I would have either taken it further or toned it down a bit. I get the feeling that this is somehow incomplete. 6', '2011-01-09 00:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6276969, 927755, 51747, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Maybe the composition could be better.</td>', 'Nice idea. Maybe the composition could be better.', '2011-01-09 00:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6277053, 927571, 29777, '<td valign="top">This is a nice idea and a very difficult subject to shoot. Some of the glare caused by the light on the camera right is causing some distracting highlights and reflections. Also a portion of the spoon seems to disappear into the background in a way the is less that flattering.</td>', 'This is a nice idea and a very difficult subject to shoot. Some of the glare caused by the light on the camera right is causing some distracting highlights and reflections. Also a portion of the spoon seems to disappear into the background in a way the is less that flattering.', '2011-01-09 02:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6277054, 927875, 29777, '<td valign="top">This is a nice idea and a very difficult subject to shoot. Some of the glare caused by the light on the camera right is causing some distracting highlights and reflections. Also a portion of the spoon seems to disappear into the background in a way the is less that flattering.</td>', 'This is a nice idea and a very difficult subject to shoot. Some of the glare caused by the light on the camera right is causing some distracting highlights and reflections. Also a portion of the spoon seems to disappear into the background in a way the is less that flattering.', '2011-01-09 02:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6277058, 927918, 29777, '<td valign="top">I like a lot of things about this shot. The different colors of hardware, the variety, some shine and some are dull. If the subject is the overall texture of the collection as a whole, I think a DOF that has everything equally sharp would work better. In this case, my eye keeps going to the brightest, sharpest item in the very center of the shot. A good shot but the message to me is different than the title suggests.</td>', 'I like a lot of things about this shot. The different colors of hardware, the variety, some shine and some are dull. If the subject is the overall texture of the collection as a whole, I think a DOF that has everything equally sharp would work better. In this case, my eye keeps going to the brightest, sharpest item in the very center of the shot. A good shot but the message to me is different than the title suggests.', '2011-01-09 02:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6277059, 927479, 29777, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit soft overall. nice texture and shadow.</td>', 'Seems a bit soft overall. nice texture and shadow.', '2011-01-09 03:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
