(6278332, 927676, 113245, '<td valign="top">To quote Benicio Del Toro, "I won and I get to scream and jump a little. But I got to go back to work tomorrow". This is quite cool, though. <br/> <br/>That said, I''d like to sincerely thank everyone for their votes and for all your great comments. It''s really nice to be part of an international community of like-minded, focused, dedicated  and caring photographer/artists. The DPC tribe is truly inspirational.<br/> <br/>As far as the picture goes, yes, the drawers were arranged. Then, after test exposures, this was shot painting with an LED flashlight. PP was sharpening and resizing.  <br/> <br/>Thanks again to everyone.<br/></td>', 'To quote Benicio Del Toro, "I won and I get to scream and jump a little. But I got to go back to work tomorrow". This is quite cool, though.  That said, I''d like to sincerely thank everyone for their votes and for all your great comments. It''s really nice to be part of an international community of like-minded, focused, dedicated  and caring photographer/artists. The DPC tribe is truly inspirational. As far as the picture goes, yes, the drawers were arranged. Then, after test exposures, this was shot painting with an LED flashlight. PP was sharpening and resizing.   Thanks again to everyone.', '2011-01-10 01:21:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(6278342, 927147, 86447, '<td valign="top">Dust bunny... almost dead center along the right side of the image.  Very clear on my monitor.<br/>Before I enter a challenge, I put my image on the monitor and then adjust levels back and forth to see it as every level monitor would see it.  Or... at least I try to remember.   It only takes one comment during voting to remind me that I forgot.  *sigh*<br/> <br/>But... I do still love the composition and your fun sense of humor.</td>', 'Dust bunny... almost dead center along the right side of the image.  Very clear on my monitor.Before I enter a challenge, I put my image on the monitor and then adjust levels back and forth to see it as every level monitor would see it.  Or... at least I try to remember.   It only takes one comment during voting to remind me that I forgot.  *sigh* But... I do still love the composition and your fun sense of humor.', '2011-01-10 01:26:21.000000', NULL, 0),
