(6278442, 927928, 30214, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Yo_Spiff:</b></div><hr/><i> Cool effect. The only problem with shots like this is that it is difficult to get both the mirror bits and the reflection to both be in focus. I had the same issue with this entry of mine, though in my case, I chose to have the reflection OOF.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=636714" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/806/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_636714.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/806/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_636714.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/806/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_636714.jpg"/></a> </i></td></tr></table> <br/>not impossible in advanced editing :)<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=858563" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1177/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858563.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1177/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858563.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1177/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858563.jpg"/></a> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Yo_Spiff: Cool effect. The only problem with shots like this is that it is difficult to get both the mirror bits and the reflection to both be in focus. I had the same issue with this entry of mine, though in my case, I chose to have the reflection OOF.  not impossible in advanced editing :) ', '2011-01-10 02:37:10.000000', NULL, 0),
