(6278482, 927859, 86218, '<td valign="top">hey Silent Shooter.<br/> <br/>Excellent placing and just missing on the top 10. Nice take and Im surprised by your selective Sats here...:)<br/>Border was not needed or maybe a bit different would have helped. I think I need to come to you or you to me and see how you process your images..take me through the steps you have done above. Looking at the graph above it''s an amazing score.<br/></td>', 'hey Silent Shooter. Excellent placing and just missing on the top 10. Nice take and Im surprised by your selective Sats here...:)Border was not needed or maybe a bit different would have helped. I think I need to come to you or you to me and see how you process your images..take me through the steps you have done above. Looking at the graph above it''s an amazing score.', '2011-01-10 03:13:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(6278519, 927849, 92577, '<td valign="top">Great start to the year - you''re becoming a ribbon mill!<br/>(PP is spot on BTW)</td>', 'Great start to the year - you''re becoming a ribbon mill!(PP is spot on BTW)', '2011-01-10 05:04:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(6278521, 927853, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657241" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657241.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657241.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657241.jpg"/></a> A soul in bits?  For some reason this is redolent of the ''50s for me - I really can''t say why.  The selenium tone, the fractured young woman with the perfect profile, I''m not sure.  But it speaks volumes.</td>', ' A soul in bits?  For some reason this is redolent of the ''50s for me - I really can''t say why.  The selenium tone, the fractured young woman with the perfect profile, I''m not sure.  But it speaks volumes.', '2011-01-10 05:13:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(6278523, 927852, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657242" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657242.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657242.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657242.jpg"/></a> Rabid Space Suits!  The tones in this are simply wonderful, rich blacks, bright whites, with a full range between.  The composition is dynamic, and the focus spot on.  And it''s just so disco.</td>', ' Rabid Space Suits!  The tones in this are simply wonderful, rich blacks, bright whites, with a full range between.  The composition is dynamic, and the focus spot on.  And it''s just so disco.', '2011-01-10 05:16:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(6278526, 927405, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657243" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657243.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657243.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_657243.jpg"/></a> Glorious tones, rich and deep, and the soft glow bring this into dream realms.  Slightly disturbing - it reminds me of Meret Oppenheim''s teacup.  Do we dare to take the muffs?  When offered by such an alarming hand, do we dare not?</td>', ' Glorious tones, rich and deep, and the soft glow bring this into dream realms.  Slightly disturbing - it reminds me of Meret Oppenheim''s teacup.  Do we dare to take the muffs?  When offered by such an alarming hand, do we dare not?', '2011-01-10 05:21:16.000000', NULL, 0),
