(6278894, 927870, 68947, '<td valign="top">What a shame that this didn''t ribbon!!!  It SHOULD HAVE!!!  I gave it a 10 because I thought it was not only brilliantly creative and well done technically but, it made me smile!  Kudos to you for such a comically intriguing shot and BAH HUMBUG to those voters who gave this those 1''s, 2''s, 3''s and 4''s!<br/>ETA:  The "D" in DPC...apparently doesn''t stand for "Deep" LOL  <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-01-10 11:55:00.</i></td>', 'What a shame that this didn''t ribbon!!!  It SHOULD HAVE!!!  I gave it a 10 because I thought it was not only brilliantly creative and well done technically but, it made me smile!  Kudos to you for such a comically intriguing shot and BAH HUMBUG to those voters who gave this those 1''s, 2''s, 3''s and 4''s!ETA:  The "D" in DPC...apparently doesn''t stand for "Deep" LOL  ', '2011-01-10 11:52:18.000000', '2011-01-10 11:55:00.000000', 0),
