(6278964, 927147, 123348, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LydiaToo:</b></div><hr/><i> Dust bunny... almost dead center along the right side of the image.  Very clear on my monitor.<br/>Before I enter a challenge, I put my image on the monitor and then adjust levels back and forth to see it as every level monitor would see it.  Or... at least I try to remember.   It only takes one comment during voting to remind me that I forgot.  *sigh*<br/> <br/>But... I do still love the composition and your fun sense of humor. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Lydia, thank you for taking the time to explain. I still cannot see it, not on any of the three but that does not mean that it is not there. I Have been loosing pixles on my camera and maybe that''s it. Again, thank you for your comments and your help! :)</td>', 'Originally posted by LydiaToo: Dust bunny... almost dead center along the right side of the image.  Very clear on my monitor.Before I enter a challenge, I put my image on the monitor and then adjust levels back and forth to see it as every level monitor would see it.  Or... at least I try to remember.   It only takes one comment during voting to remind me that I forgot.  *sigh* But... I do still love the composition and your fun sense of humor.  Lydia, thank you for taking the time to explain. I still cannot see it, not on any of the three but that does not mean that it is not there. I Have been loosing pixles on my camera and maybe that''s it. Again, thank you for your comments and your help! :)', '2011-01-10 13:53:51.000000', NULL, 0),
